# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in. Never commit `.dev.vars`.
#
# The API token needs read access to Cloudflare Artifacts. It stays in the
# Worker; the browser only ever talks to this app's own origin.
#
# `wrangler types` reads this file's *real* counterpart, so rerun
# `vp run cf-typegen` after adding or renaming a variable.
ARTIFACTS_ACCOUNT_ID=""
ARTIFACTS_NAMESPACE=""
ARTIFACTS_API_TOKEN=""
